  "summary": "Sierra Vista City Council directed staff to terminate the city's contract with Flock for license plate readers following a work session where residents and officials raised concerns about Flock's ownership of captured images, potential data sales, and use of AI. The council also asked staff to explore alternative ALPR vendors.",
  "key_quotes": [
    {
      "quote": "Sierra Vista City Council has directed staff to look into terminating the city's contract with Flock, the company behind the recently installed license plate readers.",
      "paragraph_idx": 6
    },
    {
      "quote": "Most of the concerns raised were about Flock owning the rights to the photos captured and potentially selling the data to other entities.",
      "paragraph_idx": 8
    },
    {
      "quote": "The city will be required to give Flock a 30-day notice to cancel the contract.",
      "paragraph_idx": 11
    }
